!! Ashes
Move into #/ashes (the rite's one-line form, PR and owed tails by row ID): `row7-s3b` (PR #171, if landed by the time you run; else name it landing), `canon-state` (PR #170). True #/the-order and controller-handoff #/state: the span head, S3b landed (or landing), the lanes left (b1-lift, b1-seal), the defaults now rulings, the new owed rows, the Codex pool spent toward its reset (2026-11-09).

